{"channelId":"UCDWFPLyFlXLQxqkEqNv0oow","row":["The Herd That Heals: Tecate Horse Rescue",164,"Welcome to The Herd That Heals — where rescued horses find new life, and in the process, help humans heal too. 🐴💜\n\nHere you’ll meet incredible rescue stories, learn how horses teach us compassion, resilience, and trust, and see the daily life of running a 100-acre horse rescue and wellness ranch. From before-and-after transformations to inspiring lessons from the herd, each video is a reminder that healing is possible — for horses and humans alike.\n\nExpect:\n✨ Heartfelt rescue stories\n✨ Equine-assisted therapy insights\n✨ Behind-the-scenes ranch life\n✨ Live music & storytelling with the herd\n✨ Ways you can join our mission\n\nSubscribe and be part of a community that believes in second chances. Together, we rescue, rehabilitate, and reconnect — because when horses heal, humans heal too.","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDWFPLyFlXLQxqkEqNv0oow","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDWFPLyFlXLQxqkEqNv0oow","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:55.547Z","channelId":"UCDWFPLyFlXLQxqkEqNv0oow","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"405fceeb5c16ca96f5d47bdced208d87ed456bf25c83283b4d8f16ce477fa09c","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"b0473720ab5ef8da9cde59fb4b3b7bea49d2e01b0e3c65c46e8de6dac6ec3e11"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDWFPLyFlXLQxqkEqNv0oow","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":164,"raw":"164 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDWFPLyFlXLQxqkEqNv0oow","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:55.547Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"single_sample","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z3igrogQaOQ"]}],"cleanup":{"status"